---
---

<section class="py-section-gap px-6 bg-surface-container-lowest -mt-32 pt-48 relative z-0" id="funcionalidades">
	<!-- Floating Decorative Elements -->
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[56px] text-secondary/10 absolute top-[10%] right-[5%] animate-float-medium -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">mark_chat_unread</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[72px] text-action-emerald/10 absolute top-[40%] left-[2%] animate-float-slow -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">bar_chart</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[40px] text-primary/10 absolute bottom-[20%] right-[10%] animate-float-fast -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">quick_replies</span>

	<div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto relative z-10">
		<div class="text-center mb-20">
			<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-6">Poderoso por baixo, simples por cima</h2>
			<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl mx-auto">Tudo o que você precisa para gerenciar contatos, enviar campanhas e coletar feedback, organizado em uma interface amigável.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
			<!-- Card 1: Envio em Massa (Large) -->
			<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-8 bg-surface-container-low rounded-[2rem] border-0 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(45,106,79,0.15)] hover:shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(45,106,79,0.2)] transition-shadow duration-300 overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative group">
				<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-secondary-container/20 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10 group-hover:bg-secondary-container/30 transition-colors"></div>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[120px] text-primary/5 absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">send</span>
				<div class="p-10 md:p-12 flex-1 relative z-10">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary-container flex items-center justify-center text-pure-white shadow-lg">
							<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">send</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-md text-on-surface">Envio em Massa Inteligente</h3>
					</div>
					<p class="font-body-lg text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8 max-w-xl">
						Alcance todos os seus clientes com um clique. Crie listas segmentadas, agende mensagens e mantenha sua comunidade sempre atualizada sem esforço manual.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-surface-variant/50 p-6 md:p-8 mt-auto relative h-80 overflow-hidden">
					<img alt="Interface de envio em massa inteligente" class="absolute inset-x-8 -bottom-8 w-[calc(100%-64px)] h-auto rounded-t-2xl shadow-2xl object-cover object-top border-4 border-surface-container-lowest transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-4" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDQRDoGjiBjeMDdoxevZ2v6dxYvE-dVfRViJx9MJ4jF0fgtvSWRFWr8KKB93KUm7K3ep-HrgB7qFM8c0NPkCzz_z6FN31W-dDVphBK1D4QR9k05MX5fj849ZcN7M2oQF9Eidd57rWW302pl7Sq5Jgx_X6YYnXsX5NsZN1MIm2Ujw23nJ_hYYXTXTapki4-2ExLU2B4CPeQLDQlDI-lj9FTsMY8Rlrrng9fXk6Hy4NaDnhO_AAceAFeijOjwTdNk8II5">
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Card 2: Gestão de Clientes (Vertical) -->
			<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 bg-primary text-pure-white rounded-[2rem] shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(15,82,56,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(15,82,56,0.4)] transition-shadow duration-300 overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative group">
				<div class="absolute -bottom-20 -right-20 w-80 h-80 bg-primary-container rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[100px] text-pure-white/5 absolute top-10 right-10 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">stacked_bar_chart</span>
				<div class="p-10 md:p-12 flex-1 relative z-10">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary shadow-lg">
							<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">groups</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-md text-pure-white">Gestão de Clientes</h3>
					</div>
					<p class="font-body-lg text-body-md text-on-primary-container mb-8">
						Organize seus contatos de forma visual e intuitiva. Acompanhe o histórico de engajamento e crie conexões mais fortes.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="px-8 pt-8 mt-auto h-64 relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-t from-deep-forest/50 to-transparent">
					<img alt="Painel de gestão de clientes" class="absolute inset-x-8 top-8 w-[calc(100%-64px)] h-auto rounded-t-2xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-primary-container object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-2" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAaTBROgeGKAsoPiZhqSQwE3-StnWbSiSfpIR9H08RjShddrDHAYqjseK7PnEvLjs1sbPD3b0m8lV-ZKVYcYf9YtiX5dxU8Dc_CbBAFa-kMfHa1gNY6r3jRXq5YeTzf6fnLofp_dBwQYWEYaDubQWWxS1xptHuY9DXNQ7ITfy3ePYhDLpP3gbJqV7wYZf9P9S_jnDz1cqGDsBfy8_zLA1EGzLmlQgMhwNbycTrYbISLID2g-2MWkdoHpjiCtaJ5W7Aq">
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Card 3: QR Code -->
			<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12 bg-surface-container rounded-[2rem] shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(45,106,79,0.1)] hover:shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(45,106,79,0.15)] transition-shadow duration-300 p-10 md:p-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16 relative overflow-hidden group">
				<div class="absolute right-0 top-0 w-96 h-96 bg-secondary-fixed/30 rounded-full blur-[100px] -z-10 translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/3"></div>
				<div class="absolute left-0 bottom-0 w-64 h-64 bg-primary-fixed/30 rounded-full blur-[80px] -z-10 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2"></div>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[150px] text-action-emerald/5 absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">contact_phone</span>
				<div class="flex-1 relative z-10">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-pure-white shadow-lg">
							<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">qr_code_scanner</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Cadastro Instantâneo na Loja</h3>
					</div>
					<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 max-w-2xl">
						Transforme visitantes da sua loja física ou ateliê em contatos digitais em segundos. Basta o cliente escanear o QR Code para iniciar uma conversa automática no WhatsApp e entrar na sua lista.
					</p>
					<ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 font-body-lg text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
						<li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[24px] bg-secondary/10 rounded-full p-1">check_circle</span> Ideal para balcões e vitrines</li>
						<li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[24px] bg-secondary/10 rounded-full p-1">check_circle</span> Mensagem de boas-vindas customizável</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<!-- Decorative Mockup -->
				<div class="w-full md:w-1/3 flex justify-center relative z-10">
					<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary-container/20 rounded-full blur-[60px] -z-10"></div>
					<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl border-2 border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-center rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500">
						<div class="w-full aspect-square bg-surface-container-high rounded-xl mb-6 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
							<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[100px] text-primary drop-shadow-md">qr_code_2</span>
						</div>
						<p class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-center text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-widest bg-surface-container px-4 py-2 rounded-full">Escaneie para novidades</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
